omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7TkGvTn_W3sQ7kNvwE_WKZZ&_nc_oc=AdosMc6gk-ayo0MlM3MZoLgJPnSuW7L0M2SeXAX1jde5Xrs710XsKaJ4O6ppN8QaSmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIN1tWgt2Cf-j_Do9pUjkmGhBtWLN4uWyn0jE3fKctqng&oe=6ABD2934"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LmE853SgAcAQ7kNvwGgpBOb&_nc_oc=Adoq1H39bpP14QokdLw6-YzHnShRmpacLSz9CkK7FoWLuATpE-AUNILOYK43RSj4CZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIC1z0etNBRE_JQ3CIdvLpAMMaMzs9mUbP9Ng3l-VbLhg&oe=6ABD2A96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=412RhifQWG4Q7kNvwFhLEsQ&_nc_oc=AdpzHwY0YiwosUpYzqPSVApGxSE3N5pk7-856CjADLx53y8Ejd19sEsu9Gs_UCKqxKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKs2JcwZthFg4h7XhNQiaPV9CkFiV3pYMKGvm0ecZBv_Q&oe=6ABD0777"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://